    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.6-flash:generateContent",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "key",
              "value": "YOUR-GEMINI-API-KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n  {\n    contents: [\n      {\n        parts: [\n          {\n            text: `You are a video research assistant.\n\nAnalyze this script line and the available context.\n\nSCRIPT LINE:\n${$json.originalLine}\n\nCURRENT MEANING:\n${$json.meaning}\n\nCURRENT VISUAL NEEDED:\n${$json.visualNeeded}\n\nCURRENT SEARCH QUERY:\n${$json.searchQuery}\n\nYour task is to identify the MAIN PERSON, TEAM, COMPANY, EVENT, LOCATION, PRODUCT, or OTHER SPECIFIC ENTITY that the footage should focus on.\n\nRules:\n\n1. If a person's name is explicitly mentioned, use that exact person.\n2. If the line uses pronouns such as he, she, his, her, they, etc., use the context to determine who the pronoun refers to.\n3. If the main person/entity is established by the context, use that exact name.\n4. If the sentence describes a reaction, the search must focus on that same person/entity.\n5. Never replace a specific person with a generic word such as driver, athlete, celebrity, or team.\n6. The YouTube search query MUST contain the main person's/entity's name whenever a specific subject exists.\n7. Make the query suitable for finding real YouTube footage.\n8. Prefer interviews, reactions, press conferences, races, events, news footage and other real footage.\n9. Do not invent a person or entity.\n10. If there is genuinely no specific subject, return an empty mainSubject.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"mainSubject\": \"\",\n  \"subjectType\": \"\",\n  \"refinedSearchQuery\": \"\",\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}\n\nExample:\n\n{\n  \"mainSubject\": \"Fernando Alonso\",\n  \"subjectType\": \"person\",\n  \"refinedSearchQuery\": \"Fernando Alonso reaction interview Aston Martin contract\",\n  \"reason\": \"The sentence is about Fernando Alonso and the footage should focus on him.\"\n}`\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    generationConfig: {\n      temperature: 0.1,\n      responseMimeType: \"application/json\"\n    }\n  }\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        -2192,
        256
      ],
      "id": "0ea3abaf-ab3f-4139-ad56-56e205cdfad3",
      "name": "Identify Main Subject"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const response = $json;\n\nlet text =\n  response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || '';\n\ntext = text.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();\n\nlet result;\n\ntry {\n  result = JSON.parse(text);\n} catch (error) {\n  result = {\n    mainSubject: '',\n    subjectType: '',\n    refinedSearchQuery: ''\n  };\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...$json,\n    mainSubject: result.mainSubject || '',\n    subjectType: result.subjectType || '',\n    refinedSearchQuery: result.refinedSearchQuery || ''\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1936,
        256
      ],
